WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.988
Marvell is buying a laser

00:00:01.788 --> 00:00:03.457
maker in an all-stock deal

00:00:03.257 --> 00:00:05.135
worth a hundred and fifteen

00:00:04.935 --> 00:00:07.232
billion dollars, including debt.

00:00:07.932 --> 00:00:09.728
Lumentum holders get four and

00:00:09.528 --> 00:00:11.132
a half Marvell shares for

00:00:10.932 --> 00:00:11.707
each share.

00:00:11.747 --> 00:00:13.505
That is about eleven hundred

00:00:13.305 --> 00:00:15.194
and thirty-two dollars a share.

00:00:15.744 --> 00:00:17.356
That headline counts debt.

00:00:17.396 --> 00:00:19.187
Reuters puts the equity value

00:00:18.987 --> 00:00:20.459
at about one hundred and

00:00:20.259 --> 00:00:21.668
two and a half billion.

00:00:22.218 --> 00:00:24.332
AI clusters are thousands of

00:00:24.132 --> 00:00:25.608
chips acting as one.

00:00:25.648 --> 00:00:27.070
Over longer runs,

00:00:26.870 --> 00:00:29.011
copper fades, so data travels

00:00:28.811 --> 00:00:30.233
as light from lasers.

00:00:30.783 --> 00:00:32.601
Lumentum guided to as much

00:00:32.401 --> 00:00:33.924
as one point six three

00:00:33.724 --> 00:00:35.910
billion dollars in revenue this

00:00:35.710 --> 00:00:38.483
quarter, above what analysts expected.

00:00:39.033 --> 00:00:41.777
In February, Marvell bought Celestial

00:00:41.577 --> 00:00:43.303
AI, an optical startup.

00:00:43.343 --> 00:00:44.793
In August it signed a

00:00:44.593 --> 00:00:45.973
big Google chip deal.

00:00:46.013 --> 00:00:47.962
This one should close in

00:00:47.762 --> 00:00:49.537
the first half of 2028.

00:00:50.087 --> 00:00:51.966
Marvell owes five point eight

00:00:51.766 --> 00:00:53.511
billion dollars if it walks

00:00:53.311 --> 00:00:55.056
away, and three point two

00:00:54.856 --> 00:00:57.138
billion if regulators block the deal.

00:00:57.688 --> 00:00:59.461
An IG Group analyst told

00:00:59.261 --> 00:01:01.112
Reuters it is an enormous

00:01:00.912 --> 00:01:03.078
bet, and that investors are

00:01:02.878 --> 00:01:04.965
right to ask whether Marvell

00:01:04.765 --> 00:01:05.909
is overpaying.

00:01:06.459 --> 00:01:08.346
Watch Marvell's S-4 filing,

00:01:08.146 --> 00:01:10.103
any deep antitrust review,

00:01:09.903 --> 00:01:11.789
and Marvell's share price,

00:01:11.589 --> 00:01:13.195
which sets what the deal

00:01:12.995 --> 00:01:13.687
is worth.

00:01:14.237 --> 00:01:15.692
The scarce thing in AI

00:01:15.492 --> 00:01:16.738
used to be the chip.

00:01:16.778 --> 00:01:19.349
Now chipmakers pay chip-sized prices

00:01:19.149 --> 00:01:20.037
for lasers.

00:01:20.077 --> 00:01:21.431
The full story is on

00:01:21.231 --> 00:01:22.223
The Dispatch.

